#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/subplot.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.subplot.subplot:52
msgid ""
"Position of the subplot tag on the plot. It can be specified in two ways:  - "
"A :doc:`2-character justification code </techref/justification_codes>` for "
"a   position inside the plot, e.g., ``\"TL\"`` for Top Left corner inside "
"the plot. - A :class:`pygmt.params.Position` object to fully control the "
"position and   offset. **Note**: the ``refpoint`` property of the Position "
"object must be   an two-character justification code, and ``cstype`` must be "
"set to either   ``\"inside\"`` or ``\"outside\"``,  If not specified, "
"defaults to Top Left corner inside the plot with the offset default to "
"``(\"4p\", \"4p\")``, i.e., 20% of the :gmt-term:`FONT_TAG` size."
msgstr ""

